        <p>
          Aerosol manufacturing represents a technically complex but highly rewarding branch of industrial FMCG and pharmaceutical production. Successful commercial scale-up is determined by the precise alignment of physical formulation parameters, mechanical gassing controls, and complete, uncompromised ATEX safety zoning.
        </p>
        <p>
          For entrepreneurs, investors, and technical managers, working with specialized chemical formulation consultants from day one is the most reliable way to design compliant plant layouts, select correct gassing lines, and ensure commercial success.
        </p>
